# Terraform
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
*.tfplan

# State holds resource detail; keep it in VCS per architecture/tenant/building.md
# ("VCS for small deployments"), but never the backups or any *.tfvars that
# might carry a token.
*.tfstate.backup
*.auto.tfvars
secrets.auto.tfvars

# Rendered credentials, if anyone copies one in here
*.env
